{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSListItemAvatar","kind":"identifier"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemAvatar","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" displays a circular visual identifier that can represent a user, a contact,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or any entity. It supports three content types: a predefined icon, a custom image, or text initials.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"An optional ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSBadgeStandard","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSBadgeIcon","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" can be attached at the bottom-trailing corner to indicate status."}]},{"level":2,"anchor":"Avatar-types","text":"Avatar types","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemAvatar\/AvatarType","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" enum defines the content displayed inside the avatar:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".icon","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": A predefined person\/people icon from the current theme’s resource bundle.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".image(_:)"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": A custom "},{"code":"Image","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" asset that fills the avatar circle."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"code":".initials(_:)","type":"codeVoice"}]},{"type":"text","text":": A short text string (2 characters maximum) rendered centered in the avatar."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Sizes","text":"Sizes","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemAvatar\/Size","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" enum defines the available sizes for the avatar:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".medium"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": The default size, suited for standard list items.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".large","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": A larger variant for increased visual prominence.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".extraLarge"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": The largest variant, typically used for profile-like displays.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Note:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" When the avatar is embedded in a list item with small size"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(via "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/SwiftUICore\/View\/oudsListItemSize(_:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"), the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"size"},{"type":"text","text":" parameter is "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"ignored"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and the avatar is always rendered at its smallest available size."}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Badge","level":2,"text":"Badge"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An optional badge "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSBadgeStandard","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSBadgeIcon","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" can be placed at the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"bottom-trailing corner of the avatar to convey status information (e.g. online presence, notification count)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The badge is rendered with a safety-area border matching the theme’s "},{"code":"controlItem.colorBadgeSafetyArea","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The recommended badge sizes per avatar size are:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".medium"},{"type":"text","text":" avatar → "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".extraSmall"},{"type":"text","text":" badge"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".large"},{"type":"text","text":" avatar → "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".small"},{"type":"text","text":" badge"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".extraLarge","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" avatar → "},{"code":".medium","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" badge"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Code-samples","level":2,"text":"Code samples"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["    \/\/ Avatar with predefined icon, medium size","    OUDSListItemAvatar(type: .icon, size: .medium)","","    \/\/ Avatar with a custom image, large size","    OUDSListItemAvata